    "preamble": "This Criminal Petition Is Filed vs Public Prosecutor For The on 21 July, 2020 Author: K.Suresh Reddy Bench: K.Suresh Reddy Hon'Ble Sri Justice K.Suresh Reddy Criminal Petition No. 2670 of 2020 Order:",
